        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3136226?u=5d5e6a3ec492970073606b81b1e1f7a307dd1175&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">RTCRtpScriptTransform</code> API is available since Chrome 128 as an <strong>Experimental Web Platform Feature</strong>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>👩‍🔬 <a href=\"https://wpt.fyi/results/webrtc-encoded-transform\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wpt.fyi/results/webrtc-encoded-transform</a></li>\n<li>👩‍🔬 <a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/jib1/wx3Lczrs/146/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://jsfiddle.net/jib1/wx3Lczrs/146/</a></li>\n<li>🔗 <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/354881878#comment7\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/354881878#comment7</a></li>\n<li>🔗 <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5175278159265792\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5175278159265792</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26967",
            "title": "Chrome 128 supports RTCRtpScriptTransform behind flag",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-02T17:27:28.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-06-02T17:26:37.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "jan-ivar",
                "url": "https://github.com/jan-ivar"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added partial_implementation, as they are not fully working, for:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">Hightlight.add()</code> - CSS Highlight API</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">HightlightRegistry.set()</code> - CSS Highlight API<br>\nNeither of these methods allow chaining but work individually</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Tested in the following Browsers:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Nightly 141 - not working</li>\n<li>Firefox Beta 140 - not working</li>\n<li>Chrome 136 - works as expected</li>\n<li>Safari 18.5 - works as expected<br>\nTested with the following codepens:</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://codepen.io/CodeRedDigital/pen/LEVNgqL?editors=1111\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS Highlight .add()</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://codepen.io/CodeRedDigital/pen/LEVNBOm?editors=1111\" rel=\"nofollow\">HighlightRegistry.set()</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1969004\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1969004</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39750\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/39750/hovercard\">Content PR</a></li>\n<li>Firefox Release PR - soon</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26965",
            "title": "Firefox 140 only partially implements `Highlight.add()` & `HighlightRegistry.set()`",
